msgid "VirtIO-GPU 与 DRM/KMS"
msgstr "VirtIO-GPU and DRM/KMS"

msgid "设备与构建"
msgstr "Devices and build configuration"

msgid ""
"``drivers/virtio/`` 实现 VirtIO 1.x 现代 PCI transport 与 split virtqueue； "
"``drivers/video/drm/virtio/`` 实现 PCI ``1af4:1050`` 的 controlq、cursorq、 2D 资源、VirGL 上下文及 "
"DRM/KMS。适用于 QEMU 的 ``virtio-vga``、 ``virtio-gpu-pci`` 及其 GL 变体；不实现 legacy-only、MMIO 或 packed "
"ring。"
msgstr ""
"``drivers/virtio/`` implements the VirtIO 1.x modern PCI transport and split virtqueues. "
"``drivers/video/drm/virtio/`` implements controlq, cursorq, 2D resources, VirGL contexts and "
"DRM/KMS for PCI ``1af4:1050``. It targets QEMU ``virtio-vga``, ``virtio-gpu-pci`` and their GL "
"variants. Legacy-only devices, MMIO transport and packed rings are not implemented."

msgid ""
"``VIRTIO_PCI``、``DRM`` 和 ``DRM_VIRTIO_GPU`` 在 defconfig 中默认启用。 ``DRM=m`` 时，VirtIO 后端和 vmwgfx 同属 "
"``drm.ko``，transport 保持内置； 使用匹配构建的 ``modules_install`` 结果加载，不兼容 Linux 二进制模块。"
msgstr ""
"``VIRTIO_PCI``, ``DRM`` and ``DRM_VIRTIO_GPU`` are enabled in defconfig. With ``DRM=m``, the "
"VirtIO backend and vmwgfx are included in ``drm.ko``, while the transport remains built in. Load "
"``modules_install`` output from the matching build; upstream Linux binary modules are not "
"compatible."

msgid "用户态接口"
msgstr "Userspace interfaces"

msgid ""
"主设备为 ``/dev/dri/card0``，使用标准 major 226。只在 host 协商了 VirGL 且返回受支持 capset 时提供 "
"``/dev/dri/renderD128``。GETPARAM、GET_CAPS、 "
"RESOURCE_CREATE、MAP、RESOURCE_INFO、TRANSFER、EXECBUFFER、WAIT 使用 Linux VirtGPU ioctl；每个 DRM 文件具有独立 "
"GEM handle 与 VirGL 上下文。"
msgstr ""
"The primary device is ``/dev/dri/card0`` with standard major 226. ``/dev/dri/renderD128`` is "
"published only when the host negotiates VirGL and returns a supported capset. GETPARAM, GET_CAPS,"
" RESOURCE_CREATE, MAP, RESOURCE_INFO, TRANSFER, EXECBUFFER and WAIT use Linux VirtGPU ioctls. "
"Each DRM file has an independent GEM handle namespace and VirGL context."

msgid ""
"KMS 提供连接器、EDID、模式、CRTC、线性 XRGB8888/ARGB8888 framebuffer、 DIRTYFB、legacy modeset/page "
"flip、DPMS、primary plane 及 64×64 硬件光标。 连接器数量来自设备，最多 16 个；实际模式和连接状态来自显示信息， "
"``/sys/class/drm/card0-Virtual-N/`` 发布对应 status、enabled、modes 和 EDID。 翻页事件在 host fence "
"完成后发送，时间戳使用 CLOCK_MONOTONIC；这不是物理 vblank 同步保证，不报告硬件 vblank 或 async page flip 能力。"
msgstr ""
"KMS provides connectors, EDID, modes, CRTCs, linear XRGB8888/ARGB8888 framebuffers, DIRTYFB, "
"legacy modeset/page flip, DPMS, primary planes and 64×64 hardware cursors. The device supplies "
"the connector count, up to 16, and display information supplies actual modes and connection "
"state. ``/sys/class/drm/card0-Virtual-N/`` exposes the matching status, enabled, modes and EDID "
"attributes. Flip events follow completion of the host fence and use CLOCK_MONOTONIC timestamps. "
"They do not guarantee synchronization to physical vblank; hardware vblank and async page flip "
"capabilities are not advertised."

msgid ""
"同设备 PRIME 导入导出使用 canonical DMA-BUF OFD，支持 mmap 和 DMA_BUF_IOCTL_SYNC。EXECBUFFER 支持输入和输出 sync_file "
"fence； poll、SYNC_IOC_FILE_INFO、SYNC_IOC_MERGE 和 deadline hint 使用 Linux UAPI。 跨设备 DMA-BUF、atomic "
"KMS、syncobj、resource blob、host-visible mapping、 context-init、Venus/Vulkan 与视频编解码加速尚未实现，能力查询不宣称支持。"
msgstr ""
"Same-device PRIME import/export uses a canonical DMA-BUF OFD and supports mmap and "
"DMA_BUF_IOCTL_SYNC. EXECBUFFER accepts input and output sync_file fences. Poll, "
"SYNC_IOC_FILE_INFO, SYNC_IOC_MERGE and deadline hints use the Linux UAPI. Cross-device DMA-BUF, "
"atomic KMS, syncobj, resource blobs, host-visible mappings, context-init, Venus/Vulkan and "
"accelerated video codecs are not implemented or advertised."

msgid "生命周期与错误"
msgstr "Lifetime and errors"

msgid ""
"每条命令使用独立 coherent DMA、唯一 fence 和经校验的回复长度。IRQ 只消费 used ring 和发布完成状态，资源回收在任务上下文执行。描述符支持乱序完成及 16 "
"位环回绕；MSI-X 不可用时尝试 MSI，最终保留有界轮询。用户指针在提交 之前复制，BO、映射、PRIME、sync_file 和在途请求保留实际 provider owner。"
msgstr ""
"Each command uses independent coherent DMA storage, a unique fence and validated response "
"lengths. IRQ handlers only consume the used ring and publish completion state; resource "
"retirement runs in task context. Descriptors support out-of-order completion and 16-bit ring "
"wrap. MSI-X falls back to MSI and finally bounded polling. User pointers are copied before "
"submission. BOs, mappings, PRIME, sync_file and in-flight requests retain the actual provider "
"owner."

msgid ""
"关闭文件、释放 master、切换 VT 或卸载不能提前释放 host 正在使用的页面。 请求超时先 reset，设备状态确认归零后才能释放 DMA；reset 失败保留页面与 模块引用。退出 "
"Xorg 时将 scanout 重新绑定独立的文本控制台资源。"
msgstr ""
"Closing a file, releasing master, switching VTs or unloading must not free pages still used by "
"the host. A timed-out request first resets the device; DMA is freed only after the device status "
"is observed to be zero. Failed reset retains pages and module references. On Xorg exit, scanout "
"is rebound to an independent text-console resource."

msgid ""
"panic 通道在初始化时预留命令 DMA 和队列描述符，只供停止其他 CPU 后的 fatal owner 使用，不获取普通 GPU 锁或执行分配。GUI panic 只上传已绘制文字 "
"所在矩形，保留其他桌面像素；TTY 使用保留的控制台资源。设备不响应时放弃 该显示通道，串口诊断仍继续。panic 后不恢复普通队列执行。"
msgstr ""
"The panic channel reserves command DMA and queue descriptors during initialization. Only the "
"fatal owner may use it after stopping the other CPUs; it acquires no ordinary GPU lock and "
"performs no allocation. GUI panic uploads only the rectangles occupied by drawn text, preserving "
"other desktop pixels. TTY panic uses the retained console resource. If the device does not "
"respond, display output is abandoned while serial diagnostics continue. Normal queue execution "
"never resumes after panic."

msgid "验证与上游来源"
msgstr "Validation and upstream sources"

msgid ""
"``tools/test_virtio.py`` 在 ASan/UBSan 下运行生产 ring 实现，覆盖乱序、 131080 次环回绕、背压、非法 used entry 及 fatal "
"预留链。原生用户态探针 ``tools/tests/virtgpu_guest.c`` 可用 musl 编译，执行实际 DRM、PRIME、 sync_file、sysfs、翻页和光标操作；用 "
"``--no-pause`` 跳过截图握手。 完整系统、Mesa/EGL、Xorg、BIOS/UEFI 及模块重载的 QEMU 编排由 ReliefOS 持有。 离屏 draw "
"速率不能替代桌面帧率或实体显卡性能。VMware 验证未完成。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/test_virtio.py`` runs the production ring implementation under ASan/UBSan, covering out-"
"of-order completion, 131080 ring-wrap operations, backpressure, malformed used entries and the "
"reserved fatal chain. Compile the native userspace probe ``tools/tests/virtgpu_guest.c`` with "
"musl to exercise actual DRM, PRIME, sync_file, sysfs, page flip and cursor operations. ``--no-"
"pause`` skips the screenshot handshake. ReliefOS owns QEMU orchestration for the full system, "
"Mesa/EGL, Xorg, BIOS/UEFI and module reload. Offscreen draw rates do not establish desktop frame "
"rates or physical GPU performance. VMware validation is incomplete."

msgid ""
"协议参考 OASIS VirtIO 1.3 第 4.1、2.7 和 5.7 节。VirtGPU、VirtIO-GPU 与 sync_file UAPI 原样取自 Linux "
"v6.12，commit ``adc218676eef25575469234709c2d87185ca223a``。实现代码独立编写， 采用 Apache-2.0；头文件保留 BSD、MIT "
"或带 Linux-syscall-note 的原有许可， 具体版权与许可文本见仓库 NOTICE，不导入 Linux DRM 实现。"
msgstr ""
"The protocol reference is OASIS VirtIO 1.3 sections 4.1, 2.7 and 5.7. VirtGPU, VirtIO-GPU and "
"sync_file UAPI headers are unchanged Linux v6.12 files from commit "
"``adc218676eef25575469234709c2d87185ca223a``. The independently written implementation uses "
"Apache-2.0. Headers retain their BSD, MIT or original license with Linux-syscall-note; see NOTICE"
" for copyrights and license texts. No Linux DRM implementation is imported."
